      "body": "Stack from [ghstack](https://github.com/ezyang/ghstack/tree/0.18.0) (oldest at bottom):\n* __->__ #5356\n\nRaising under Dynamo never reaches the user: Dynamo treats the exception as a\ngraph break and reruns the frame eagerly, where the check passes. The forward\nthen mixes compiled and eager Linears, and activation checkpointing's recompute\ndiverges from it (CheckpointError in whole-model torch.compile + FullAC).\n\n- uses_inplace_wgrad_accum returns False under Dynamo; the graph traces F.linear\n- Keep the make_fx (GraphTrainer) raise, which does propagate\n- Tests: compiled Linear/HiMidLo grads match flag off; FullAC + compile regression",
